-- =====================================================================
-- This is an ECLIPSE-type input file for fluid properties using the
-- ad-blackoil module in MRST. This file is for a two-phase fluid system 
-- with CO2 (dry gas) and brine (live oil). PVT properties are for 80C of 
-- temperature (i.e approx 2km of depth), and two regions are specified for
-- both kr-Pc and rock compressibility (keyword ROCK).
-- File for upscaling of Pc and kr using CL (pc, kr) and VL (kr). Since only
-- incompressible flow is used during upscaling, PVT properties are simplified.
-- =====================================================================
